r to help yvonne  since they found  out end quote this last part is  important because it provides some much  needed context that we didn't have  earlier pokey says that fed started  complaining about yvonne after he  inappropriately touched her  but before anyone else in the house knew  about it furthermore poki says that  fed's screenshotted text messages  of her complaining about yvonne are just  pokey parroting fed's complaints  because at the time that's the only  perspective she had  feds quote given the context that i now  have of what fed had  done to her of course i would never have  said those things or wanted her fired  anyone in her position would have  reacted the same way in an attempt to  avoid someone who has touched them  inappropriately  end quote pokey also alleges that fed  was complaining about yvonne to other  members of otv  and then eventually a meeting was called  to deal with this problem based on fed's  complaints  but again remember nobody else in the  house yet knew about yvonne's  allegations towards fed  she ends this section by saying her and  yvonne have talked pokey apologized for  the way it was handled  and that she's quote really grateful for  everything she's done for us  the next section breaks down her  relationship with fed and it's here  where she clarifies the timeline a  little bit  she says that her and fed grew close on  a trip to taiwan in 2018  and briefly considered dating pokey says  that this is where a lot of the flirty  text messages that fed references  came from but in may of 2018 pokey says  she told fed that she only ever wanted  to be friends and then shortly after  that is when the steve  incident happened steve was some dude  pokey was into  fed told steve him and pokey had a thing  she saw this as a massive breach of  trust  confronted him about it he apologized i  think you get the point what's  interesting  here is that pokey actually asked fed if  there was anything he didn't want her to  talk about  on